      "post_id": "2126007094956749106",
      "url": "https://x.com/sudiprokaya/status/2126007094956749106",
      "text": "I reverse engineered Temu, the world's #1 shopping app (2x Amazon's downloads). \n\nThe results are shocking.\n\nThe free gift wheel you see when you sign up is a pre-made animation. They pick your prize before you tap.\n\nTheir code has a \"fakeCouponCard.\"",
      "original_text": "I reverse engineered Temu, the world's #1 shopping app (2x Amazon's downloads). \n\nThe results are shocking.\n\nThe free gift wheel you see when you sign up is a pre-made animation. They pick your prize before you tap.\n\nTheir code has a \"fakeCouponCard.\"",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "我逆向工程了 Temu，这款全球排名第 1 的购物应用（下载量是 Amazon 的 2 倍）。\n\n结果令人震惊。\n\n你注册时看到的免费礼品转盘是预先制作好的动画。他们在你点击之前就选好了你的奖品。\n\n他们的代码里有一个“fakeCouponCard”。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户在 公开社媒上讨论与品牌相关的购物体验。",
