      "url": "https://x.com/SajberInfoBlog/status/2125862855774011416",
      "text": "Temu blocked my PayPal after a justified refund for misleading ads (90 DIN vs 70 delivered). Their system initiates bank holds, abandons the order, won't void. Their 'Senior Specialists' admit THEY paused it, then blame my bank. Escalated to @PayPal. #Temu #ConsumerRights #Scam",
      "original_text": "Temu blocked my PayPal after a justified refund for misleading ads (90 DIN vs 70 delivered). Their system initiates bank holds, abandons the order, won't void. Their 'Senior Specialists' admit THEY paused it, then blame my bank. Escalated to @PayPal. #Temu #ConsumerRights #Scam https://t.co/NAGFXvHYAK",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "Temu 在一次合理退款后封了我的 PayPal，原因是误导性广告（90 DIN vs 实际送达 70）。他们的系统发起银行冻结，放弃订单，又不愿撤销。他们的“Senior Specialists”承认是他们暂停了订单，然后却怪我的银行。已升级给 @PayPal。#Temu #ConsumerRights #Scam",
